{"id": "Ugzk5IjGwaFlWZT4uL94AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 21, "text": "Thomas, this is one of those songs that doesn’t speak of a feeling slowly growing... it speaks of that instant when something happens and we can no longer pretend we don’t feel it. There’s such a strong energy in that move from doubt to certainty, as if a single look were enough to change everything. And I especially love the idea of no longer hiding what has become impossible to hide... when the feeling finally finds the courage to be spoken. ❤❤ ❤", "published": "2026-09-23T13:04:41", "replies": 3, "creator": false}
{"id": "Ugzk5IjGwaFlWZT4uL94AaABAg.Ab5stcDPnReAb8p2-rdHow", "parent": "Ugzk5IjGwaFlWZT4uL94AaABAg", "likes": 4, "text": "Exactly. I wanted the song to capture that instant when you realize the feeling is already stronger than your ability to hide it ☺🥰", "published": "2026-09-24T16:28:44", "replies": 0, "creator": true}
